Part II. Instance files: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
================================================================================

Scope:
  - m0/data/            the frozen instance files (graphs, questions, labels and
                        the prompts built from them);
  - m0/results/ and e3/results/, as distributed in this repository: the files
                        computed from the instance files without any model
                        (k_min shares, shortcut ceilings, k_min distributions of
                        the test sets, token counts).

