================================================================================
Part III. Third-party material (not distributed in this repository)
================================================================================

The scripts download or query the following material, which remains under its
own terms. Users are responsible for complying with them.

  Datasets
  - ogbg-molhiv, Open Graph Benchmark: MIT License.
  - ogbn-arxiv, Open Graph Benchmark: Open Data Commons Attribution License
    (ODC-BY).

  Model weights and services (accessed through Hugging Face or an API; no
  weights are included here)
  - Qwen2.5 instruct models at 0.5B, 1.5B, 7B, 14B and 32B, Qwen2.5 base models
    at 0.5B, 1.5B and 7B, and MPT-7B: Apache License 2.0.
  - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct: Qwen Research License.
  - Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct: Qwen License.
  - Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct: Llama 3.1 Community License.
  - Gemma-2-9B-it: Gemma Terms of Use.
  - BLOOM-7B1: BigScience RAIL License.
  - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B: MIT License (its Qwen2.5 base: Apache License
    2.0).
  - GPT-4o: OpenAI terms of use.

  Python packages listed in requirements.txt are installed separately and are
  governed by their own licenses.
